  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252faether-overworld-ores\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Prospector/badges/master/modrinth-badge-72h-padded.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"183\" height=\"72\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fen.wikipedia.org%252fwiki%252fAll_rights_reserved\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/assets license-All Rights Reserved-red.svg?style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" width=\"204\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/The-Aether-Team/Overworld-Ores/blob/1.21.1-develop/LICENSE.txt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/code license-LGPL v3.0-green.svg?style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" width=\"142\" height=\"20\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://patreon.com/TheAetherTeam\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=TheAetherTeam&amp;type=patrons&amp;style=flat-square&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"147\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/aethermod\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/118816101936267265.svg?label=discord&amp;logoColor=FFFFFF&amp;logo=discord&amp;color=7289DA&amp;style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" width=\"141\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/DevAether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/twitter-@DevAether-lightgrey?style=flat-square&amp;logo=twitter&amp;color=1DA1F2&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"143\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmastodon.gamedev.place%252f%2540DevAether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/mastodon/follow/110581810287361848?domain=https://mastodon.gamedev.place/&amp;style=flat-square&amp;logo=mastodon&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=mastodon&amp;color=858AFA\" alt=\"Mastodon\" width=\"99\" height=\"20\"></a>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbsky.app%252fprofile%252faether-mod.net\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://custom-icon-badges.demolab.com/badge/bluesky-@aether--mod--net-green?logo=cloud&amp;logoSource=feather&amp;style=flat-square&amp;color=0085ff\" alt=\"\" width=\"179\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.threads.net%252f%2540devaether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://custom-icon-badges.demolab.com/badge/threads-devaether-green?logo=instagram-threads&amp;style=flat-square&amp;color=000000\" alt=\"\" width=\"133\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.facebook.com%252fAetherMod\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/facebook-AetherMod-blue?logo=facebook&amp;style=flat-square&amp;color=1877F2&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"145\" height=\"20\"></a>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/devaether-instagram?color=D50060&amp;label=instagram&amp;logo=instagram&amp;style=flat-square&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.tiktok.com%252f%2540devaether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/@devaether-tiktok?color=000000&amp;label=tiktok&amp;logo=tiktok&amp;style=flat-square&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"135\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@DevAether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/youtube-@DevAether-blue?color=FF0000&amp;label=youtube&amp;logo=youtube&amp;style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" width=\"151\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/theaetherteam\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitch/status/theaetherteam?logo=twitch&amp;style=flat-square&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"103\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.reddit.com%252fr%252fTheAether%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/TheAether-reddit?color=FF4500&amp;label=reddit&amp;logo=reddit&amp;style=flat-square&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"127\" height=\"20\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252faether.wiki.gg%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://custom-icon-badges.demolab.com/badge/wiki.gg-aether-green?logo=wikigg&amp;style=flat-square&amp;color=FF1980\" alt=\"\" width=\"111\" height=\"20\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>⛏️ 關於此附加元件 ⛏️</strong></span></h2><p>「主世界礦石」附加元件<strong>實作了與原版及模組化礦石相對應的全新聖石變種礦石方塊</strong>，這些礦石將<strong>在天界維度中自然生成</strong>，其生成機率與分佈範圍與主世界中的對應礦石相似。模組化礦石變種僅在安裝了相應模組時才會生成。此附加元件並未涵蓋所有模組化礦石的兼容性，但模組包創作者可以建議希望加入的其他礦石。</p><p>此附加元件旨在協助模組包製作者，他們希望將特定礦石方塊加入天界，而無需玩家返回主世界進行採集，例如適用於純天界生存的情境。模組包創作者亦可透過資料包，依照自身需求配置所有預設功能，例如生成機率或合成配方結果。</p><p>目前支援的兼容性包括：</p><ul>\n<li>錫礦；<em>熱力基礎、鐵路工藝、通用機械</em>。</li>\n<li>鉛礦；<em>熱力基礎、鐵路工藝、通用機械、餘燼、沉浸工程</em>。</li>\n<li>銀礦；<em>熱力基礎、鐵路工藝、餘燼、沉浸工程</em>。</li>\n<li>鎳礦；<em>熱力基礎、鐵路工藝、沉浸工程</em>。</li>\n<li>鋅礦；<em>鐵路工藝、機械動力</em>。</li>\n<li>鈾礦；<em>通用機械、沉浸工程</em>。</li>\n<li>硫磺礦；<em>熱力基礎、鐵路工藝</em>。</li>\n<li>機械動力的礦石粉碎配方。</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/The-Aether-Team/.github/main/images/overworldOres0.png\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h2><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>☁️ 更多來自天界團隊的作品 ☁️</strong></span></h2><p>若您對此附加元件有任何疑問，或對天界團隊開發的其他專案感興趣，歡迎加入「天界專案」Discord！我們友善的工作人員與熱情的社群將確保您賓至如歸！</p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/aethermod\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/The-Aether-Team/.github/main/images/image4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"282\" height=\"102\"></a></p><p>您亦可在 Patreon 上贊助天界團隊！每一份贊助都將直接投入開發工作，支持我們持續投入最熱愛的事業。<a href=\"https://patreon.com/TheAetherTeam\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/The-Aether-Team/.github/main/images/image3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"434\" height=\"102\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
